From f9cf39fe15b47d08e7f58e827be59e020863da3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chessiro <chessiro@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 13:34:24 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Chessiro WebAssembly build (single- and multi-threaded)

- chessiro/: em++ Makefile, C++/JS glue, embedded NNUE via wasm .incbin, PGO script
- Single-threaded flavour: no pthreads, Asyncify yield from check_time so 'stop'
  works without SharedArrayBuffer
- Multi-threaded flavour: UCI loop on a proxied pthread fed by a JS command queue
- Non-fatal handling of malformed position/go commands (browser must not die)
- Threads option capped, NUMA/log options hidden, elapsed_time >= 1ms
- Qualified SearchManager::check_time call (direct Asyncify call graph)

No functional change to search or evaluation: bench 2793281
